    pm:withinTradition pmt:JewishPracticalMagic ;
    dcterms:source "Ḥarba de-Moshe, part III, no. 25 (trans. Moses Gaster, The Sword of Moses: An Ancient Book of Magic, London: David Nutt, 1896; the numbering of part III is the editor's)" .

